Channel your mental power through your wielded mindstars, generating psionic blades.

Mindstar psiblades have their damage modifiers (how much damage they gain from stats) multiplied by [1.40, 1.53, 1.64, 1.72, 1.80 (TL1-5)], their armour penetration by [1.16, 1.37, 1.53, 1.67, 1.79 (TL1-5)] and mindpower, willpower and cunning by [1.40, 1.53, 1.64, 1.72, 1.80 (TL1-5)].

Also passively increases weapon damage by [29%, 42%, 51%, 59%, 66% (TL1-5)] and physical power by 30 when using mindstars.
